    <link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="https://learn.adafruit.com/adafruit-rv-8803-high-accuracy-real-time-clock"/>
    <url>https://learn.adafruit.com/adafruit-rv-8803-high-accuracy-real-time-clock</url>
    <title>Adafruit RV-8803 High Accuracy Real Time Clock</title>
    <content type="html">&lt;p&gt;Excellent time keeping within ±1.5 ppm over STEMMA QT&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href='https://learn.adafruit.com/adafruit-rv-8803-high-accuracy-real-time-clock'&gt;&lt;img src='https://cdn-learn.adafruit.com/guides/images/000/004/643/medium500/6538-00.jpg?1793020766' /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;For excellent accuracy time-keeping - when your everyday RTC (Real Time Clock) won't do - the Adafruit RV-8803 Precision Real Time Clock Breakout Board is a tick-tock above the rest with excellent ±1.5 ppm (at 0~50°C) accuracy. Thanks to the built-in crystal with temperature compensation management, classic RTC drift is minimized so you don't have to do any time correction with WiFi or GPS to keep current. &lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;a href='https://learn.adafruit.com/adafruit-rv-8803-high-accuracy-real-time-clock'&gt;Learn More&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</content>
    <updated>2026-11-02T14:36:54Z</updated>
    <author>
      <name>Liz Clark</name>
    </author>
  </entry>
