    <url>https://learn.adafruit.com/stitch-different-led-illuminated-embroidery-with-noods</url>
    <title>Stitch Different: LED-Illuminated Embroidery with nOOds</title>
    <content type="html">&lt;p&gt;Make a classic embroidered design glow with flexible LED filaments.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href='https://learn.adafruit.com/stitch-different-led-illuminated-embroidery-with-noods'&gt;&lt;img src='https://cdn-learn.adafruit.com/guides/images/000/004/648/medium500thumb/apple_embroidery_reveal_smooth_650x400.gif?1793306327' /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Give a classic logo a glowing upgrade with machine embroidery and Adafruit LED nOOds! This guide explores how to turn an idea into an embroidery design, then stitch it out using a computerized embroidery machine. &lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;a href='https://learn.adafruit.com/stitch-different-led-illuminated-embroidery-with-noods'&gt;Learn More&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</content>
    <updated>2026-11-02T10:17:50Z</updated>
