    <title>FLAC and Ogg Playback with CircuitPython</title>
    <content type="html">&lt;p&gt;Your music, your way&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href='https://learn.adafruit.com/flac-and-ogg-playback-with-circuitpython'&gt;&lt;img src='https://cdn-learn.adafruit.com/guides/images/000/004/641/medium500/hero.jpg?1792594008' /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;CircuitPython with Turbo expands the music encoding playback options to FLAC and Ogg files with fast microcontrollers.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;a href='https://learn.adafruit.com/flac-and-ogg-playback-with-circuitpython'&gt;Learn More&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</content>
