    <url>https://learn.adafruit.com/4-port-usb-hub-for-ikea-mittzon-desk</url>
    <title>4-Port USB Hub for IKEA Mittzon Desk</title>
    <content type="html">&lt;p&gt;Customize your desk with an embedded 4-port USB hub&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href='https://learn.adafruit.com/4-port-usb-hub-for-ikea-mittzon-desk'&gt;&lt;img src='https://cdn-learn.adafruit.com/guides/images/000/004/635/medium500/hero-mittzon-usbhub.jpg?1791913356' /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Use the CH334F Mini 4-Port USB Hub Breakout to make your own USB Hub thats built-in your Ikea Mittzon desk!&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;a href='https://learn.adafruit.com/4-port-usb-hub-for-ikea-mittzon-desk'&gt;Learn More&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</content>
