    <link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="https://learn.adafruit.com/supernova-pov-pixel-poi-v2"/>
    <url>https://learn.adafruit.com/supernova-pov-pixel-poi-v2</url>
    <title>Supernova POV Pixel Poi V2 with Wireless Controller</title>
    <content type="html">&lt;p&gt;Control multiple persistence-of-vision props with RF &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href='https://learn.adafruit.com/supernova-pov-pixel-poi-v2'&gt;&lt;img src='https://cdn-learn.adafruit.com/guides/images/000/003/816/medium500/pov_poi_duet_2.jpeg?1791240648' /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Build your own POV poi and control them remotely with a Feather 2040 RFM69. Send images for your performance in real time with a touchscreen or joystick controller. Make a professional level performance prop and light up the night.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;a href='https://learn.adafruit.com/supernova-pov-pixel-poi-v2'&gt;Learn More&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</content>
