    <link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="https://learn.adafruit.com/adafruit-cp2105-friend-usb-to-dual-uart-serial-converters"/>
    <url>https://learn.adafruit.com/adafruit-cp2105-friend-usb-to-dual-uart-serial-converters</url>
    <title>Adafruit CP2105 Friend - USB to Dual UART Serial Converters</title>
    <content type="html">&lt;p&gt;Two serial UART ports without any hub required&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href='https://learn.adafruit.com/adafruit-cp2105-friend-usb-to-dual-uart-serial-converters'&gt;&lt;img src='https://cdn-learn.adafruit.com/guides/images/000/004/114/medium500/6065-00.jpg?1729796442' /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;USB is hard, and you just want to transfer your every-day serial data from two serial ports to a single USB port without the complexity of a hub. What now? Enter the Adafruit CP2105 Friend! It has two serial UART ports without any hub required.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;a href='https://learn.adafruit.com/adafruit-cp2105-friend-usb-to-dual-uart-serial-converters'&gt;Learn More&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</content>
    <updated>2026-10-19T10:08:17Z</updated>
    <author>
      <name>Liz Clark</name>
    </author>
  </entry>
  <entry>
    <id>tag:learn.adafruit.com,2005:Guides::External/4638</id>
    <published>2026-10-13T10:51:36-04:00</published>
