    <url>https://learn.adafruit.com/led-bubble-hair-extensions-with-motion-controlled-effects</url>
    <title>LED Bubble Hair Extensions with Motion Controlled Effects</title>
    <content type="html">&lt;p&gt;Clip-in Hair that reacts when you shake your stuff&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href='https://learn.adafruit.com/led-bubble-hair-extensions-with-motion-controlled-effects'&gt;&lt;img src='https://cdn-learn.adafruit.com/guides/images/000/004/631/medium500thumb/hairgif.gif?1790986021' /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Seed pixels and a PropMaker Feather make this hair accessory dance! Tilt or shake your head to trigger raindrop animations in your favorite colors. Light up the festival when you dance!&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;a href='https://learn.adafruit.com/led-bubble-hair-extensions-with-motion-controlled-effects'&gt;Learn More&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</content>
