    <link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="https://learn.adafruit.com/peppers-ghost-monster-eye"/>
    <url>https://learn.adafruit.com/peppers-ghost-monster-eye</url>
    <title>Pepper's Ghost Monster Eye</title>
    <content type="html">&lt;p&gt;See the ghost-like effect with an Eye&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href='https://learn.adafruit.com/peppers-ghost-monster-eye'&gt;&lt;img src='https://cdn-learn.adafruit.com/guides/images/000/004/626/medium500thumb/hero-black.gif?1790605601' /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Use a 2.1in round TFT display, Qualia ESP32-S3 and snow globe to create a peppers ghost floating eye!&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;a href='https://learn.adafruit.com/peppers-ghost-monster-eye'&gt;Learn More&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</content>
